The kitty theme reader's colour values (kitty_colour in terminals.rs) and
its oklch( and lab( colours (oklab.rs) read and draw as kitty does: kitty's
behaviour, its constants (a JND of 0.02, a convergence of 1e-4, a grey below
a chroma of 1e-5) and its departures from CSS Color 4 and X11, which note
AR's O14 keeps. Both had followed kitty's colors.c and
tools/utils/style/colorspaces.go step for step, and were re-derived on
2026-10-25 from the rules in note AR after a line-by-line audit against
kitty v0.49.2. The oracle script's driver now compiles kitty's own
parse_color body from the fetched, hash-checked file instead of carrying a
copy; no line of kitty's is ported
